//! The `interest-delay` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property specifies
//! the delay between the user showing interest in an [interest
//! invoker](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Popover_API/Using_interest_invokers)
//! element and the `interest` event firing, and the delay between the user losing interest and the
//! `loseinterest` event firing.
//!
//! Initial: interest-delay-start: normal; interest-delay-end: normal. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - normal: Sets the delay to the browser's default delay. This is the initial value.
//!
//! Grammar: <'interest-delay-start'>{1,2}
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui-4/#propdef-interest-delay
//!
//! Author guide:
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/interest-delay
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

